# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The GitHub repository carries graph-loop PRODUCT content only.
#
# Local agent-work files, benchmark/network setup and machine-specific records
# are ignored here as a second line of defence. Ignore rules do NOT untrack:
# anything already tracked must be removed from the index as well
# (`git rm --cached <path>`, which keeps the working-tree file). The commit
# scope guard (automation/bin/check-commit-scope.sh) enforces the same split
# at commit and push time. Policy: automation/commit-policy.txt.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Product build artifacts and installed deps (regenerated, never source) --
node_modules/
dist/
lib/
# Committed script helpers live under scripts/lib/ (not build output).
!/scripts/lib/
*.tgz
*.tsbuildinfo
.npmrc.local

# --- Local-only agent infrastructure (never committed) ----------------------
# Agent prompts/roles/reports, harness automation, benchmark + network setup,
# recurring audits, and status records with machine paths / run state.
/automation/
/bench/
/docs/audits/
/.githooks/
/PROGRESS.md
/docs/STATUS.md
/docs/EVALUATION.md
# Instruction files for local agents at any depth (root and per-directory).
AGENTS.md

# --- Local machine state and secrets ---------------------------------------
.secrets/
.dsh-home/
tmp/
jobs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pid
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editor, OS and test-runner junk ---------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.log
*.orig
*.rej
.idea/
.vscode/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
